Formato Object: #o:ID|Nombre|Data|Descripcion|ability_id|LocationID|InventoryType
Use ability_id = 0 for no ability
InventoryType = {UNKNOWN_INVENTORY == 0, PLAYER_INVENTORY == 1, NPC_INVENTORY == 2, SPACE_INVENTORY == 3}

#o:1|Grain1|NONE|Grano1|0|11|3
#o:2|Grain2|NONE|Grano2|0|11|3
#o:3|Grain3|NONE|Grano3|0|121|3
#o:4|Grain4|NONE|Grano4|0|122|3
#o:5|HP|NONE|Health Potion that heals 20 HP|1|11|3
#o:6|IHP|NONE|Infinite Health Potion that heals 20 HP and isn't consumed|0|11|3
#o:7|HTEST|wearable helmet base_damage:1 strength:1 max_health:20|Helmet TEST|0|11|3
